+# emoji_demo
+
+`emoji_demo` is a small NuttX command demo for the animation control API in
+`home_scense`. It does not copy the animation resources; it sends the selected
+resource name through `/home_scense_emoji`.
+
+The `home_scense` application must be running before requests are sent.
+
+```text
+emoji_demo list
+emoji_demo 0          # play 02
+emoji_demo drink      # play drink
+emoji_demo next       # request the next demo animation
+emoji_demo stop
+```
+
+The numeric commands are convenient for binding each command to a touch
+button in another UI. A failed request reports the negative errno returned by
+the message-queue API, for example when `home_scense` has not created its
+queue yet.
